{{also|suppe}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{der|de|gml|suppe}}, {{m|gml|soppe}}, {{m|gml|sope}}, which spread under the reinforcing influence of {{der|de|fr|soupe}}. Both from {{der|de|gem-pro|*supô}}, {{m|gem-pro|*suppô}}, which is related to {{cog|de|saufen||to drink}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈzʊpə/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-Suppe.ogg|audio (Germany)|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-Suppe.ogg|audio (Austria)|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f|Suppe|Suppen|Süppchen}}

# [[soup]]

Usage note: "Eine eingebrockte Suppe auslöffeln" literally means to eat a breaded soup with the spoon and refers to an unhappy situation to pass.

